    "section": "23. Aircraft",
    "ruleNumber": "23.04",
    "summary": "An AIRCRAFT unit can charge or direct melee attacks only against Flying units. In the other direction, only Flying units may charge AIRCRAFT, and only Flying models may target AIRCRAFT with melee attacks.",
